Q: .NET 10 - Suppressing or having control over ALL startup log messages A: <p>You can control it using the log filters.
Just add a filter to each trace's namespace and set up the log level or <code>None</code> if you want to remove it.</p>
<pre><code>var web_app_builder = Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder.WebApplication.CreateBuilder();

//example removing lifetime logs
web_app_builder.Logging.AddFilter(&quot;Microsoft.Hosting.Lifetime&quot;, LogLevel.None);

//if you want to remove everything above the Microsoft namespace
web_app_builder.Logging.AddFilter(&quot;Microsoft&quot;, LogLevel.None);
</code></pre>
